              <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" ;
              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The ETCS baseline needs to be provided for each available ETCS Level. See: TSI CCS (Table A2)"@en .


